third-party code in this repository asks to be kept with copies of it: the BSD-3-Clause, MIT, Zlib,
CC0, CC-BY and CC-BY-SA texts, with the copyright lines they apply to, and the Apache-2.0 text for
the one Apache-licensed library the part library uses, and the MPL-2.0 and BSL-1.0 texts of Eigen and
