to.

The GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (the licence of FreeCAD and of the parts of
cad-agent that derive from it, and of OndselSolver, FreeCAD's assembly solver, in ui/ondsel/upstream with
its own copy of the text) is in ui/LICENSE, and is not repeated here. The npm packages in the
workbench bundle are listed package by package, with the text each ships, in
cad_agent/workbench/next/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt, which the build writes.

Contents
  1. BSD-3-Clause: FreeCAD's dxf.cpp (Dan Heeks), and Coin (Kongsberg Oil & Gas Technologies AS)
  2. MIT: three.js, three-cad-viewer and the other packages in the workbench bundle
  3. Zlib: postprocessing, inside three-cad-viewer
  4. CC0 1.0 and ISC: n8ao, inside three-cad-viewer
  5. CC-BY 3.0: FreeCAD's material cards (cad_agent/materials.py) and the FreeCAD-library parts
  6. CC-BY-SA 2.0 and 4.0: some of FreeCAD's icons
  7. Apache-2.0: bd_warehouse (used, not shipped)
  8. MPL-2.0: Eigen, compiled into the sketch solver's WebAssembly build (ui/planegcs/dist)
  9. BSL-1.0: Boost's graph headers, compiled into the same build

